[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10021.11, "timestamp": "02:47:01", "text": "我知道我的朋友当时说：“嘿，我需要……”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10022.79, "timestamp": "02:47:02", "text": "作品集素材。我当时就想，我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10023.91, "timestamp": "02:47:03", "text": "不会让你免费工作。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10025.67, "timestamp": "02:47:05", "text": "他没事。你可以直接把它放进去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10028.55, "timestamp": "02:47:08", "text": "你知道我欠你的，就给我吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10030.71, "timestamp": "02:47:10", "text": "里面加了东西。然后我就想，“好吧，那就这样吧。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10032.79, "timestamp": "02:47:12", "text": "这个。”他回答说：“好的。”所以现在我有了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10034.79, "timestamp": "02:47:14", "text": "编辑。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10036.87, "timestamp": "02:47:16", "text": "呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10038.79, "timestamp": "02:47:18", "text": "我确实有Instagram账号，但我还没有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10042.15, "timestamp": "02:47:22", "text": "大概一年后在那里发帖。呃，我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10044.71, "timestamp": "02:47:24", "text": "一个印度人。我是一个完整的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10047.429, "timestamp": "02:47:27", "text": "纯种印度人。我出生在这里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10051.51, "timestamp": "02:47:31", "text": "印度。我在印度长大。我只是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10055.51, "timestamp": "02:47:35", "text": "有点，你知道的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10057.91, "timestamp": "02:47:37", "text": "不同的口音。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10058.87, "timestamp": "02:47:38", "text": "而这又是另一个层次的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10061.59, "timestamp": "02:47:41", "text": "拖延。我知道我知道这不好，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10064.07, "timestamp": "02:47:44", "text": "但我还是继续这么做。我不知道该怎么做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10067.83, "timestamp": "02:47:47", "text": "停止重音符号。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10071.03, "timestamp": "02:47:51", "text": "不，不，不。呃，都是因为我拖延症。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10073.59, "timestamp": "02:47:53", "text": "啊，我的意思是，每个人都有那么一两个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10076.389, "timestamp": "02:47:56", "text": "这种拖延症的程度。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10078.95, "timestamp": "02:47:58", "text": "问题是，我最终还是拖延了。"}]